title: "Prompt Brittleness: how often do harmless rephrasings change LLM answers?"
abstract: "A measurement study of prompt sensitivity: 300 items from GSM8K, MMLU and E2E extraction, rephrased one change at a time, with open models, an A/A noise floor and a held-out test of the best-scoring prompt."
